WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.625
We’re gonna have to do the shuffle again.

00:00:01.625 --> 00:00:04.000
Shuff-shuffle again. Do the shuffle again.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.041
2019, it’s the shuffle remix.

00:00:06.041 --> 00:00:08.791
Reminisce cause we missed '85, '86.

00:00:08.791 --> 00:00:10.041
Leader of the offense.

00:00:10.041 --> 00:00:11.416
The defense is so fresh,

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:12.166
I’m in the NFL

00:00:12.166 --> 00:00:13.750
and I just learned how to throw left.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:14.666
I can scramble, I can run

00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:16.166
I can throw touch passes.

00:00:16.166 --> 00:00:17.375
And I’m livin’ in the city with the

00:00:17.375 --> 00:00:18.750
most mustaches.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:19.791
Nagy can nag me

00:00:19.791 --> 00:00:20.833
but don’t call me Mitch.

00:00:20.833 --> 00:00:22.166
And my name ain’t Jay Cutler

00:00:22.166 --> 00:00:23.083
so don’t call me-

00:00:23.375 --> 00:00:23.666
Whatever?!

00:00:23.666 --> 00:00:24.625
Go to Club Dub.

00:00:24.666 --> 00:00:25.833
We all got up in

00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:28.250
bringing back '86 with the shuffle again.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.416
Last name Cohen

00:00:29.416 --> 00:00:30.708
so I get a bar mitzvah.

00:00:30.708 --> 00:00:31.833
And I got a new sweater

00:00:31.833 --> 00:00:33.375
so I’m dressed like Mike Ditka.

00:00:33.375 --> 00:00:35.541
And we don’t mean this is a mean way

00:00:35.541 --> 00:00:36.708
Cheese-eating hillbillies

00:00:36.708 --> 00:00:38.083
all live in Green Bay.

00:00:38.083 --> 00:00:38.833
D-D-D-DEFENSE!!!!!!!

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:39.416
Check the movement

00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:40.208
monsters of the midway

00:00:40.208 --> 00:00:41.291
defense superhuman.

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:42.791
Never losin’, and we get stupid

00:00:42.791 --> 00:00:44.625
stupid like when I was traded by Gruden.

00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:45.625
Turn a player to a hater

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:46.250
when I hit a player

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:46.958
QB incinerator

00:00:46.958 --> 00:00:48.041
imitator of refrigerator.

00:00:48.041 --> 00:00:48.458
HICKS.

00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:48.833
FULLER.

00:00:48.833 --> 00:00:49.541
JACKSON.

00:00:49.541 --> 00:00:50.875
Defense killin’.

00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:52.166
And I’m worth 2 first-round draft picks

00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:53.458
and $141 million.

00:00:53.458 --> 00:00:55.833
In 2019, take it back to '86.

00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:57.000
When we win, we’ll do

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.541
the Super Bowl Shuffle remix.

00:00:58.541 --> 00:00:59.208
Hopefully.

